  (text "Functional pin names identify the wires; they are NOT manufacturer terminal numbers.\nMicroswitch COM/NO closes when pressed. Lamp has two separate terminals; observe LED polarity.\nThe light and switch circuits must remain separate. Insulate unused NC contacts, if present.\nAdafruit 1194 includes a series LED resistor. Verify EG STARTS 12 V lamp module and current before use."
    (at 20 30 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "eaed3178-5b48-4324-9d5c-3b41fe30ee85"))
